{"4565430": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Mushroom Simulator Co-op", "steam_appid": 4565430, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4565430/extras/3277bc399b0689123b996d3262ca121e.avif?t=1782417862\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4565430/extras_big/3277bc399b0689123b996d3262ca121e.webp?t=1782417862 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It's a world where you're a mushroom and so are your friends</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SPEAK AND GROW</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voice waves magically feed your mycelium, speeding up your growth. Got a hedgehog eyeing your cap? Yell at it, and it'll realize it messed with the wrong mushroom - but be careful: noise can draw unwelcome guests, so sometimes it's best to shut up...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STAY QUIET AND SURVIVE </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a forager with a basket walks into your clearing, your only chance is to pretend you're not there. One sneeze and all that's left of you is spores.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PICKED? EATEN?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No big deal - scatter your spores and start fresh. <strong>Mushrooms never give up!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PLAY WITH FRIENDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get random mushroom skins, find your spot in a cozy clearing, and survive together with friends. Along the way you'll meet strange creatures and learn to accept yourself for who you are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No quests, no bosses.</strong> Just you, the forest, and everyone who lives in it.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It's a world where you're a mushroom and so are your friends</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SPEAK AND GROW</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voice waves magically feed your mycelium, speeding up your growth. Got a hedgehog eyeing your cap? Yell at it, and it'll realize it messed with the wrong mushroom - but be careful: noise can draw unwelcome guests, so sometimes it's best to shut up...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STAY QUIET AND SURVIVE </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a forager with a basket walks into your clearing, your only chance is to pretend you're not there. One sneeze and all that's left of you is spores.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PICKED? EATEN?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No big deal - scatter your spores and start fresh. <strong>Mushrooms never give up!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PLAY WITH FRIENDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get random mushroom skins, find your spot in a cozy clearing, and survive together with friends. Along the way you'll meet strange creatures and learn to accept yourself for who you are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No quests, no bosses.</strong> Just you, the forest, and everyone who lives in it.</p>", "short_description": "You're a mushroom. Your friends are mushrooms too. Grow big, enjoy the rain, watch out for worms and the forager with a basket. No quests, no bosses. Just you, the forest, and that worm that crawled up at the wrong moment again.", "supported_languages": "English, Russian, Japanese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4565430/780d28ae99fa0402323c73946b987b32bf36741d/header.jpg?t=1782417862", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4565430/d4db422ffb7420756b7d0744a8ed4a850b179da1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782417862", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4565430/d4db422ffb7420756b7d0744a8ed4a850b179da1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=17